WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.268
In proof-of-stake networks, validators put up a stake and receive a reward.

2
00:00:05.268 --> 00:00:06.645
The risks of staking:

3
00:00:06.645 --> 00:00:10.120
penalties for validator mistakes, a withdrawal queue,

4
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.989
and the reliability of whoever you trusted with your coins.

5
00:00:13.989 --> 00:00:16.481
Liquid staking gives you an IOU token,

6
00:00:16.481 --> 00:00:19.694
but it is worth only what the market pays for it:

7
00:00:19.694 --> 00:00:23.366
in June 2022 stETH traded below ether for several weeks.
